            <td>
                <p>
                    <span class="subhead2" style="color:#a34500; font-weight: bold; font-size:15px;">(XV) Procedure for Information Retrieval</span>
                </p>
                <p style="font-size:13px">
                    Any person desirous of obtaining any   information under the provisions of Right to Information Act, 2005 shall be   required to make a request in writing to the designated Public Information   Officer (P I O) or Assistant Public Information Officer (A P I O) of the Company   accompanied with requisite fees as may be prescribed for avail;ing the desired   Information. The Designated PIO/APIO may be contacted by the Applicant&nbsp; between   1030 to 1230 hrs on Monday to Friday excluding public Holidays.
                </p>
